; The errors in an included file add to those of the file that includes
; it, before and after the include, and the exit status counts them all.

2024/00/01 Bad month before the include
    Expenses:Food    $1.00
    Assets:Cash

include include-error-count.dat

2024/01/01 Unbalanced after the include
    Expenses:Food    $1.00
    Assets:Cash      $2.00

test bal -> 4
